{"text":"Is it because women are born with a cooking gene? Or because over years they have been socialized to see cooking as their role. Actually, I was going to say that maybe women are born with the cooking gene until I remember that the majority of the famous cooks in the world who we give the fancy title of chefs are men. I used to look at my grandmother who was a brilliant, brilliant woman and wonder how she would have been if she had the same opportunities as men when she was growing up. Now today there are many more opportunities for women and there were during my grandmother's time because of changes in policy, changes in law, all of which are very important. But what matters even more is our attitude, our mindset, what we believe and what we value about gender. What if in raising children we focus on ability instead of gender? What if in raising children we focus on interest instead of gender?","words":[{"text":"Is","start":0.0,"end":0.58},{"text":"it","start":0.58,"end":0.68},{"text":"because","start":0.68,"end":0.9},{"text":"women","start":0.9,"end":1.16},{"text":"are","start":1.16,"end":1.42},{"text":"born","start":1.42,"end":1.68},{"text":"with","start":1.68,"end":1.88},{"text":"a","start":1.88,"end":2.04},{"text":"cooking","start":2.04,"end":2.36},{"text":"gene","start":2.36,"end":2.8,"punct":"?"},{"text":"Or","start":4.36,"end":4.88},{"text":"because","start":4.88,"end":5.16},{"text":"over","start":5.16,"end":5.42},{"text":"years","start":5.42,"end":5.74},{"text":"they","start":5.74,"end":5.94},{"text":"have","start":5.94,"end":6.04},{"text":"been","start":6.04,"end":6.2},{"text":"socialized","start":6.2,"end":6.7},{"text":"to","start":6.7,"end":6.94},{"text":"see","start":6.94,"end":7.18},{"text":"cooking","start":7.18,"end":7.46},{"text":"as","start":7.46,"end":7.7},{"text":"their","start":7.7,"end":7.94},{"text":"role","start":7.94,"end":8.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"Actually","start":9.1,"end":9.36,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":9.38,"end":9.44},{"t